1
00:00:00,703 --> 00:00:04,133
(Sheldon:)Is the baby a jerk
or is Bernadette a bad mother?

2
00:00:05,341 --> 00:00:06,841
Sheldon!

3
00:00:06,842 --> 00:00:08,072
W-What?

4
00:00:08,077 --> 00:00:09,177
(Sheldon:)Is there
another twist coming?

5
00:00:09,178 --> 00:00:11,148
(Sheldon:)Is the baby
not theirs at all?

6
00:00:12,781 --> 00:00:13,881
(Leonard:)Ignore him.

7
00:00:13,882 --> 00:00:15,752
(Leonard:)How did you get
the baby to stop crying?

8
00:00:15,751 --> 00:00:19,121
(Stuart:)Oh, I just talked to her.

9
00:00:19,121 --> 00:00:24,061
(Stuart:)I've been told the sound of
my voice puts people to sleep.

10
00:00:27,630 --> 00:00:29,730
(Penny:)You poor things,
you must be exhausted.

11
00:00:29,732 --> 00:00:33,902
(Howard:)It has been hard to sleep
with all the crying.

12
00:00:39,808 --> 00:00:41,838
(Bernadette:)How can she hate me?

13
00:00:41,844 --> 00:00:44,944
(Bernadette:)I make her food
in my chest!

14
00:00:46,649 --> 00:00:51,319
(Bernadette:)It's like hating
a frozen yogurt machine.

15
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:54,350
(Howard:)She doesn't hate you,
stop saying that.

16
00:00:54,356 --> 00:00:57,896
Now you hate me too!

17
00:00:57,893 --> 00:01:13,033
(Howard:)Shh, I don't hate you.

